---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: cancel()
    q_check_auth --> q_check_supplied: caller == projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_canceled: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: cannot cancel after token supply
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_capital_withdrawn: isCanceled == false
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_canceled: already canceled
    q_check_capital_withdrawn --> q_set_canceled: capitalWithdrawn == false
    q_check_capital_withdrawn --> q_return_capital: capitalWithdrawn == true
    q_return_capital --> q_set_canceled: bidToken.transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalCapitalRaised + fees)
    q_set_canceled --> q_emit: isCanceled = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleCanceled()
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_revert_canceled --> [*]: revert AlreadyCanceled

    note right of q_check_capital_withdrawn
        INV-001: post-withdrawal cancellation requires full capital + fees return
        INV-002: pre-withdrawal cancellation requires no capital return
        INV-003: cancel blocked after tokens supplied (distribution started)
    end note
